  PASS  5a  baseline with ZERO rows -> CANNOT CHECK, never 'no drift'
  PASS  5b  baseline whose rows= header LIES -> CANNOT CHECK
  PASS  5c  baseline recorded against a DIFFERENT engine -> CANNOT CHECK
  PASS  5d  no baseline at all -> CANNOT CHECK
  PASS  5d2 the no-baseline message ALSO names restart as the operator's act
  PASS  5e  current surface unparseable -> CANNOT CHECK
